            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:1",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:1",
            "text": "Henry Tyler made the catch of the year on the weekend. When he saw a young child hanging from a sixth-floor apartment balcony (阳台), Henry ran one hundred metres, jumped over a 1.2-metre fence, and held out his arms to catch the falling child."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:3",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:3",
            "text": "The Brown family live in an apartment building outside Toronto. On the day of the accident, Mrs. Brown was at work and Eric was at home with his father. They both fell asleep while watching TV."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:4",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:4",
            "text": "Eric woke up a little later when he heard children playing outside. He pushed a chair onto the balcony, and climbed up to see them. When he looked down, he accidentally slipped and fell over the edge. He hung on for a few minutes and screamed for his father, but his father didn’t hear him."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:5",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:5",
            "text": "Henry was fixing his car when he heard the screams. He looked up and saw Eric hanging from the"
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:6",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:6",
            "text": "balcony. He quickly threw his tools aside, and started running, arms out."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:7",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-ii:grammar-fill:7",
            "text": "\"He saved my son’s life,\" said Mrs. Brown. \"I don’t know how to thank him.”"
          }
        ],
